flowchart TB
  IN["Incoming unit"] --> CAND["Restricted candidate set<br/>path root · explicit id · anchors"]
  CAND --> ASSIGN["Maximum-weight one-to-one assignment<br/>no prior unit claimed twice"]
  ASSIGN --> CRIT{"critical signal<br/>has no value?"}
